(rectangle (start 297.18 152.4) (end 434.34 172.72) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 9c582006-cf78-5c35-b4c9-5ea1c64ab413))
(text "E5-04 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.1 (VBUS RTL-A, HF+); §8 (TPS2553DBVR-1 п. 2–3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 298.45 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a3705d8e-ae20-5179-ae17-692bbd1659bc))
(text "Current-setting resistors R501 (RTL-A), R509 (HF+) and R514 (T7) are engineering starting values (RILIM TBD);\nSTACK §5.1 fixes only the rule 1.5–2× measured current. No measured device steady/startup currents or\nhot-corner proof.\nВорота (стенд): Measure current/inrush; set the RTL-A/HF+/T7 limits to 1.5–2× the measured current as STACK\n§5.1 requires; confirm HF+ minimum startup ≥0.75 A. Run the STACK §8 TPS2553DBVR-1 item 3 inrush test on\nlatching U503 (HF+ LC 100 µH/100 µF + 220 µF damper) at final RILIM; only if it latches, fit TPS2553DBVR\n(constant-current) on this channel alone. Retry/latch test at all battery states; scope LC overshoot." (at 298.45 155.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 152a63be-0d84-583c-95cf-19a024e9773b))
(rectangle (start 297.18 175.26) (end 434.34 185.42) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 60 150 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 469321ea-aee0-50e9-b9c7-b3c91e60f2ba))
(text "N-E5-01 — примітка — STACK §5.1 (VBUS RTL-A); §8 (TPS2553DBVR-1 п. 2–3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 298.45 176.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4fe95be0-6098-5252-b5ed-bd8dab85bc42))
(text "R501 = RILIM TBD (старт 43.2k 1%, 0.544–0.673 A). STACK для VBUS RTL-A задає лише правило RILIM = 1.5–2×\nвиміряного струму; номінал STACK є тільки для порту LAB (R505 34.8k). Ворота: E5-04." (at 298.45 178.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 275f62a1-71e1-586f-8f07-a9bef6db9ebd))
