(text "E5-05 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.1; §5.2; §8.1 (T7)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4a8bfe43-2626-5caa-aaa9-1823d95d8e7f))
(text "T7 VBUS rail capacity and modified cable SuperSpeed signal integrity untested.\nВорота (стенд): With a real T7 prove J5 load <1.5 A expected operating budget, VCC_5V_PERI <=14 W, 5000M/UAS,\nno USB resets, fio, hot-corner TJ <=105 C for 1.5 A. Re-evaluate rail/switch/cable if failed." (at 13.97 267.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 49d10e54-efb8-5e68-901f-937134620f95))
